                                                        "code": null,
                                                        "comment": "",
                                                        "message": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong>Establish governing documentation</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Policy</li>\n<li>Standards</li>\n<li>Process</li>\n<li>Roles and Responsibilities</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong>Improve current SW model and entitlements load:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>To ensure entitlements are mapped to correct PPNs and software models mapped to correct DMAPs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong>CMDB </strong>management</span> has to be improved.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Set up basic <strong><span style=\"color: #169179;\">KPIs </span></strong>and leverage OOTB dashboards for measurement.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"
                                                    }
