sys_ux_macroponent.required_translations:
[ {
  "message" : "<p><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong>Gain visibility of your asset estate</strong></span></p>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<p><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><strong> Optimize operational efficiency&nbsp; </strong></span></p>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<p><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><strong> Optimize operational efficiency&nbsp; </strong></span></p>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>Reduce risk and mitigate cost by automating </strong></span></p>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The SAM Evolution Framework provides a phased approach to Software Asset Management, enabling organizations to improve asset visibility, reduce risks, <br />and enhance operations.It helps businesses develop a comprehensive and efficient SAM strategy over time. </span></p>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<p><strong>Progress Charts</strong></p>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<section>\n<div id=\"container-cm5kq9us70003358tvlsty78z-container_24\">\n<section>\n<div id=\"container-cm5kq9us70003358tvlsty78z-container_24\">\n<h6 data-truncationmouseover=\"true\" data-truncation=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">SAM Implementation Approach</span></h6>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong>Establish governing documentation</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Policy</li>\n<li>Standards</li>\n<li>Process</li>\n<li>Roles and Responsibilities</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong>Improve current SW model and entitlements load:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>To ensure entitlements are mapped to correct PPNs and software models mapped to correct DMAPs.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color: #169179;\"><strong>CMDB </strong>management</span> has to be improved.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Set up basic <strong><span style=\"color: #169179;\">KPIs </span></strong>and leverage OOTB dashboards for measurement.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b96ad9;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #3598db;\"><strong>Establish software reclamation rules</strong></span> </span>to optimize license usage effectively</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Capture and analyze lifecycle milestones to forecast future investments with greater precision.</p>\n</li>\n<li>Utilize the Success portal to meet targets and improve SAM health metrics.Implement the <strong><span style=\"color: #3598db; font-size: 11pt;\">'Software Spend Detection'</span></strong> application to track, analyze, and optimize software spending using imported financial data.</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #3598db; font-size: 11pt;\">Leverage the Client Software Distribution</span></strong> application for <span style=\"color: #000000;\">automated</span> software installation and uninstallation processes.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Leverage<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">software reclamation rules</span> </span></strong></span>to optimize license usage.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Capture and analyze <span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">lifecycle milestones</span></strong></span> to better determine how to<br />forecast future investments</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Leverage Success portal to achieve targets for better SAM health.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Use the 'Software Spend Detection' application to track, analyse, and optimize software<br />spending from imported financial data.</p>\n</li>\n<li>Leverage Client Software Distribution application for auto-installation and uninstallation of software.</li>\n</ul>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
  "message" : "<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Recommendation is to start with<strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"> less complex products</span></strong>.<br />Undertstand the SAM configurations.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Strategize normalization of discovery models, modelsdean up accordingly.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Utilize OOTB<strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"> Asset and Software Asset Workspaces</span></strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Set up <strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">persona-based dashboards</span></strong> and <strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">automated reporting</span></strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><strong>Executive Leadership</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><strong>Team Mangers</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><strong>Fulfillers</strong></span></li>\n<li>Identify SAM POC for solutions support and train him/her</li>\n</ul>",
  "comment" : ""
}, {
